            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - At the conclusion of debate on H.R. 3638, the Chair put the question on passage of the bill and by voice vote announced the ayes had prevailed. Mr. Pallone demanded the yeas and nays and the Chair postponed further proceedings until a time to be announced.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H34400",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-10",
            "actionTime": "19:37:32",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "The House adopted the amendments en gros as agreed to by the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H35000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-10",
            "actionTime": "19:37:15",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H32600",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-10",
            "actionTime": "19:36:25",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "The House rose from the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union to report H.R. 3638.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H8D000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-10",
            "actionTime": "19:33:10",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H.Res. 936, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Self amendment No. 5.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H8D000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-10",
            "actionTime": "19:29:07",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H.Res. 936, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Min amendment No. 4.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H8D000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-10",
            "actionTime": "19:22:32",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H.Res. 936, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the McGuire amendment No. 3.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H8D000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-10",
            "actionTime": "19:17:05",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H.Res. 936, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Min amendment No. 2.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H8D000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-10",
            "actionTime": "19:12:02",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H.Res. 936, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Gosar amendment No. 1.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H8D000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-10",
            "actionTime": "18:44:41",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "GENERAL DEBATE - The Committee of the Whole proceeded with one hour of general debate on H.R. 3638.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H32400",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-10",
            "actionTime": "18:44:31",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "The Speaker designated the Honorable James C. Moylan to act as Chairman of the Committee.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H32020",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-10",
            "actionTime": "18:44:30",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "House resolved itself into the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union pursuant to H. Res. 936 and Rule XVIII.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H8D000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-10",
            "actionTime": "18:44:07",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 3898, H.R. 3383, H.R. 3638, H.R. 3628, H.R. 3668 and S. 1071. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 3898, H.R. 3383, H.R. 3638, and H.R. 3628 under a structured rule; and H.R. 3668 and S. 1071 under a closed rule. The resolution provides for one motion to recommit on H.R. 3898, H.R. 3383, H.R. 3638, H.R. 3628, and H.R. 3668; and one motion to commit on S. 1071.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H30000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-10",
            "actionTime": "18:44:02",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 936. (consideration: CR H5528; text: CR H5531)",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H1L210",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-09",
            "actionTime": "19:52:18",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 936 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 3898, H.R. 3383, H.R. 3638, H.R. 3628, H.R. 3668 and S. 1071. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 3898, H.R. 3383, H.R. 3638, and H.R. 3628 under a structured rule; and H.R. 3668 and S. 1071 under a closed rule. The resolution provides for one motion to recommit on H.R. 3898, H.R. 3383, H.R. 3638, H.R. 3628, and H.R. 3668; and one motion to commit on S. 1071.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
